			"notes": "## v0.3.1 - Initial Release\n\nFully client-side Fabric mod intended for Beta mechanic gameplay that will auto-eat based on your health.\n\n### Features\n\n- Watches your health and tracks hotbar/inventory, automatically swapping to eat food when needed without waste\n    - If the best food is in your inventory, it will move it to your hotbar first, then eat it\n- Configurable health target, delay timings (with optional random variance) and a global toggle key\n- Toggleable action-bar feedback when eating\n- Ships with support for Beta's native foods and common fake foods used to emulate Beta mechanics in modern versions\n    - Supports adding custom food pointers if other items are used to emulate/fake Beta eating mechanics\n- Supports all Beta foods and Modern Beta (server)'s emulated items for those foods. Supports other custom foods if other servers emulate old eating with other items\n- In-game config screen (Mod Menu) available"
		}
